      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبرّد فِيهِ</span></b>  <i>He descended into it,</i> (i. e., into
water, TA,) <i>and washed himself in it, to refresh
himself by its coolness.</i> (M, K.) See also 8. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبرّد</span> also signifies (assumed tropical:)  <i>He became weakened.</i> (TA.)

